WEBVTT

00:04:59.876 --> 00:05:01.396
This has to change.

00:05:02.236 --> 00:05:03.516
And it will.

00:05:03.996 --> 00:05:07.436
Last year, the Danish government
and the Danish parliament

00:05:07.476 --> 00:05:09.316
made an important decision.

00:05:10.036 --> 00:05:15.236
We’ve decided to put an end date
on extraction of oil and gas in 2050

00:05:15.276 --> 00:05:19.436
and immediately cancel
all future licensing rounds.

00:05:19.476 --> 00:05:23.996
(Applause)

00:05:24.556 --> 00:05:26.676
That wasn't an easy decision.

00:05:26.716 --> 00:05:27.956
When we made the decision,

00:05:27.996 --> 00:05:29.996
we were the biggest
oil producer in the EU.